      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the Cloudflare Turnstile integration do?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It verifies that submissions come from real people, blocking automated bot and spam entries so your form data stays clean and reliable.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I add Cloudflare Turnstile to a form?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Click Add Elements in the form builder, select Turnstile, and publish. Test it by submitting in preview mode.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is Turnstile different from a CAPTCHA?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Turnstile verifies most visitors invisibly — no image puzzles or checkboxes — so real users almost never see a challenge.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does it work on surveys and quizzes too?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — the protection works on forms, surveys, and quizzes alike.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
